1
00:00:00,864 --> 00:00:03,376
Hi, I’m Lily from Ireland.

2
00:00:03,776 --> 00:00:06,560
I love my big family.

3
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,896
Here’s a photo of us.

4
00:00:09,184 --> 00:00:11,920
I’m the one with the pink hat.

5
00:00:12,368 --> 00:00:15,664
This is my dad, Fred, on the left.

6
00:00:16,176 --> 00:00:21,056
He’s very handsome. He often plays tennis with me.

7
00:00:21,696 --> 00:00:25,088
My little brother, Sam, is on his knee.

8
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:29,808
Sam is seven, and he really likes chess.

9
00:00:30,304 --> 00:00:33,808
My mum, Jane, is on the right.

10
00:00:34,192 --> 00:00:36,832
She’s beautiful and kind.

11
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:40,672
She always reads me a story at night.

12
00:00:41,408 --> 00:00:46,160
My grandparents, Jack and Sarah, are in the middle.

13
00:00:46,576 --> 00:00:48,624
They’re my dad’s parents.

14
00:00:49,072 --> 00:00:52,864
They have a dog. His name is Oscar.

15
00:00:53,760 --> 00:01:01,552
My grandparents have three grandchildren: Sam, my cousin Lucy, and me.

16
00:01:02,096 --> 00:01:06,000
They often say I’m their favourite grandchild,

17
00:01:06,304 --> 00:01:09,664
but I think they say the same thing to all of us!

